a purpose is charitable if
    advancement_of_education is equal to the purpose
    otherwise advancement_of_animal_welfare is equal to the purpose
    otherwise prevention_else_relief_of_poverty is equal to the purpose
    otherwise advancement_of_health is equal to the purpose
    otherwise advancement_of_religion is equal to the purpose.

the entitys name for an entity is a text if
    the entity is an individual
    and the person of the entity is a person
    and the name of the person is the text
    otherwise the entity is a corporation
    and the company of the entity is a company
    and the company name of the company is the text.

the education purpose is advancement_of_education.

